For variance_eq_coeff, the viable prefix is: unfold OpenAIMath186Extension.variance; rw [ProofSteps.mean_eq_coeff_empty]; change to the Config-side BiasedFourier.weight sum; have hvariance := BiasedFourier.variance_eq_nonempty (ι := Edge n r); simp only [Finset.nonempty_iff_ne_empty]; rw [← ProofSteps.sum_erase_eq_filter_no
…
]. After this rw, the remaining goal is exactly the conclusion of hvariance (Edge side against Finset.univ.erase ∅), so try `exact hvariance` (or `simpa` if empty notation differs). Do not whole-goal `change` Config to Edge→Bool, and do not consume hvariance directly against the Config-side sum; those variants whnf-timeout.

